sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as NexusSaga
    participant Z as ZombieSagaReaper
    participant P as Provider (lock)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka
    participant S2 as Payment (hung)
    E->>K: payment.charge
    K->>S2: FORWARD
    Note over S2: no reply (network hang / crash)
    loop every 5 s (check-interval-ms)
        Z->>P: tryLock("zombie-reaper") – one leader per cluster
        Z->>DB: ids WHERE status IN (IN_PROGRESS, COMPENSATING)<br/>AND step_started_at < now - 1s
        Z->>E: handleTimeout(sagaId)
        E->>P: lock saga:{id}
        E->>DB: re-read, stepStartedAt + timeoutSeconds < now ?
    end
    Note over E: TIMED_OUT recorded in audit
    E->>DB: TX: COMPENSATING at hung step + outbox + audit
    E->>K: payment.refund (compensate hung step itself)
    E->>K: inventory.release
    Note over E: FAILED (rolled back)
    S2--xE: late reply arrives → stale, ignored (commandId mismatch)
